# No Content-Security-Policy: Starlight ships inline scripts and the analytics
# scripts need one too, and a CSP tight enough to matter needs testing
# this pass is not doing.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
